{"publicId":"ec65ed2d-46ff-4ee3-b4f9-76b44cd94168","title":"Coinbase与Deribit合作推出美国机构期权及永续合约交易，并扩展至GRAM等新代币","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-11T22:58:18.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-11T22:58:18.000Z","digest":"Coinbase Prime于2026年11月5日面向美国机构客户推出由Deribit提供流动性的期权和永续合约交易服务，支持BTC、ETH、SOL等20余种加密资产，可用BTC、ETH、USDC作为抵押品。该服务由Coinbase与Deribit合作推出，但双方未披露具体合作模式。后续报道显示，Coinbase于2026年11月13日新增GRAM、GRASS、QNT、ZRO的永续期货合约，Deribit同期推出USDC结算的同类产品并新增PEARL代币，双方均开放零售与机构参与，但未披露合作细节及扩展范围的具体关联性。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-11T23:15:05.018Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Coinbase上线GRAM、GRASS、QNT和ZRO的永续期货合约","latestReport":{"id":"mlvpbwm6478ox7r0l6sv7vir6"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":1,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"f8zZ1O2FnloM","title":"Coinbase adds perpetual futures for GRAM, GRASS, QNT, and ZR","firstReportAt":"2026-11-11T22:58:18.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"mlvpbwm6478ox7r0l6sv7vir6","title":"Coinbase上线GRAM、GRASS、QNT和ZRO的永续期货合约","summary":"Coinbase宣布于2026年11月13日推出GRAM、GRASS、QNT和ZRO的永续期货合约，Deribit同期上线USDC结算的同类产品并新增PEARL代币。两者均开放零售与机构参与，Coinbase流动性来自Deribit部分市场，结算币种为USDC。","source":{"name":"Crypto Briefing","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T22:58:18.000Z","selected":true}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"mlvpbwm6478ox7r0l6sv7vir6","title":"Coinbase上线GRAM、GRASS、QNT和ZRO的永续期货合约","summary":"Coinbase宣布于2026年11月13日推出GRAM、GRASS、QNT和ZRO的永续期货合约，Deribit同期上线USDC结算的同类产品并新增PEARL代币。两者均开放零售与机构参与，Coinbase流动性来自Deribit部分市场，结算币种为USDC。","source":{"name":"Crypto Briefing","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T22:58:18.000Z","selected":true}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-05T08:00:00.000Z","heat":6.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T09:00:00.000Z","heat":6.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T10:00:00.000Z","heat":6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T11:00:00.000Z","heat":5.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T12:00:00.000Z","heat"